# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# The reader's gzipped corpus start-up cache, written beside data/kjv.jsonl
# when the repo itself is the data home. Regenerated; never commit.
*.idxcache

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# .NET build output (from the C# binding demo)
**/bin/
**/obj/
# …but NOT Rust's src/bin/ crate-binary sources (e.g. the plumbline-bindgen tool),
# which the broad **/bin/ rule above would otherwise swallow.
!**/src/bin/
!**/src/bin/**

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Personal study data written when the repo root is the data home (dev/testing);
# never commit — the reader's own tags/weaves/threads/notes. This list is the
# web home's USER_DIRS (apps/web/src/engine/home.ts) plus weaves/suggested and
# the retired patches dir; three of them were missing until 2026-07-29, which is
# the same hole that let 224 stock files sit tracked against this file's intent.
# The CI step "nothing is tracked against .gitignore" is the guard.
/tags/
/weaves/
/threads/
/notes/
/memory/
/reading/
/suggested/
/.config/
# The Ed25519 point-patch/rule layer was never ported (see CLAUDE.md's
# architecture table); a patches/ dir at the root is dev leftovers, not data.
/patches/

# Android signing keystores — the app's permanent signing identity. NEVER
# commit; keep it in a password manager, and feed CI via the
# ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64 GitHub secret (see .github/workflows/release.yml).
*.jks
*.keystore

# Web shell (apps/web) build artifacts — regenerated by npm run pack:data / pack:wasm / build
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/dist/
apps/web/public/pack/
apps/web/public/plumbline_ffi.wasm

# Kotlin/Gradle scratch dir (appears under apps/android on any gradle run)
.kotlin/
